subset-fallback-indexed(offsets<[u64]>, ids<[u64]>, vocabulary<u64>, posts<u64>, sub-offsets<[u64]>, sub-ids<[u64]>, sub-boundaries<[u64]>, sub-postings<[u64]>) => (out<[u64]>) :=
